<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16092" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσάμινθος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰσᾰ], ἡ,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bathing-tub,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔς ῥ᾽ ἀσάμινθον ἕσασα</span> having
			made sit in it, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				10.361
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκ ῥ᾽ ἀ. βῆ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					3.468
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔς ῥ᾽ ἀσαμίνθους βάντες ἐϋξέστας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					10.576
				</span></i>
			, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀργυρέας ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					4.128
				</span></i>
			: rare in 
				Att.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ ἀ. κύλικος λείβων</span>
			from a cup <i>as large as a bath,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
				234
			</span></i>; later, <i><span class="en">
				Artem.
				1.56
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PStrassb.</u>
				29.37
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>.</div>
